// RevenueCat sandbox API key. Get it from
// app.revenuecat.com → Project → Apps & providers → API keys → Apple App Store.
// Use the "public app-specific" key (starts with `appl_`).
// Safe to commit — RevenueCat client keys are designed to ship in the binary.
REVENUECAT_API_KEY = test_FRIzWebgAwgUOfsksltCeKwwFMX

// Dropbox app key for the staging build. Get it from
// dropbox.com/developers/apps → your app → Settings → "App key".
// Safe to ship — PKCE OAuth doesn't need the app secret.
// IMPORTANT: also update the URL scheme `db-$(DROPBOX_APP_KEY)` registration
// in Info.plist (CFBundleURLTypes) so OAuth redirects can return to the app.
DROPBOX_APP_KEY = xiw36320ig4wy2j

